  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-(--header-height)\"><br></article><article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\"><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\"><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>MiEyes is a online retailer specialising in premium eye-care and affordable contact lenses. We offer a wide range of daily, monthly, and specialist lenses alongside advanced dry-eye treatments. Our focus is on comfort, reliability, and easy access to products customers trust and use every day.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Competitive pricing on popular contact lens brands.</p></li><li><p>Specialists in premium and medical-grade dry-eye solutions.</p></li><li><p>Stock of high-demand, often hard-to-find products like Hycosan, EvoTears, Optimel, and Optase.</p></li><li><p>Strong repeat-purchase behaviour and subscription-friendly products.</p></li><li><p>Fast international shipping, especially to the USA.</p></li></ul><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Competitive commission on every sale through your unique referral link.</p></li><li><p>Earn on both affordable contact lenses and high-margin dry-eye products.</p></li><li><p>Potential for recurring commissions from repeat customers (depending on programme terms).</p></li><li><p>Transparent tracking and regular payouts.</p></li></ul><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Share your referral link on social media, blogs, email newsletters, or YouTube.</p></li><li><p>Create content around contact lens savings, comfort, or dry-eye relief.</p></li><li><p>Post product reviews, daily routines, or before-and-after experiences.</p></li><li><p>Highlight angles like affordable lenses, premium eye-care, and fast delivery.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Other information:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Global customer base, with strong demand in the UK and USA.</p></li><li><p>High average order values and strong repeat purchase rates.</p></li><li><p>Regular promotions, bundles, and seasonal offers affiliates can promote.</p></li><li><p>Dedicated support for customers and affiliates.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div></div>",
